sequenceDiagram
    participant Component as File Editor / Tree
    participant Facade as FilesFacade
    participant Effects as FilesEffects
    participant Service as FilesService
    participant API as Agent Controller

    Note over Component,API: Frontend file I/O (raw bytes)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Component,API: Read File
        Component->>Facade: readFile(clientId, agentId, path, context?)
        Facade->>Effects: readFile action
        Effects->>Service: readFile(...)
        Service->>API: GET .../files/{path}<br/>responseType=arraybuffer
        API-->>Service: 200 + ArrayBuffer + X-File-Type
        Service-->>Effects: Observable&lt;FileContentDto&gt;<br/>(fileType, contentType, text?, bodyRef?)
        Effects-->>Facade: store content
        Component->>Facade: getFileContent$(...)
        Facade-->>Component: FileContentDto | null
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Component,API: Write File
        Component->>Facade: writeFile(..., { bytes, fileType? })
        Facade->>Effects: writeFile action
        Effects->>Service: writeFile(...)
        alt size ≤ 10MB
            Service->>API: PUT full ArrayBuffer
        else chunked
            Service->>API: PUT Content-Range chunks + X-Upload-Id
        end
        API-->>Service: 204
        Service-->>Effects: void
    end
